# --- Room 1/15 ---
dig Crossroads Inn & Stables - Entrance
@desc Ancient elms tower overhead, their shimmering canopy filtering the moonlight into dancing patterns on the forest floor. The air smells of brimstone, and the ground is carpeted with thick moss.
@tags/set room-zone:crossroads_inn
@open south=south to Crossroads Inn & Stables - Bend
@open east=east to Crossroads Inn & Stables - Depths

# --- Room 2/15 ---
